WEBVTT

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.830
Because you and I are very similar...

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.710
We both lost the right to be heroes.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.040
Am I right?

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.000
Did I lose the right? I don't know.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:17.290
Lady Benio and Lady Oka are both
striving to save the entire world.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:21.630
However... I'm not so sure this world
is worth saving in the first place.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.130
Of course it is!

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.830
I know you've had similar thoughts.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:27.790
Because there's something more precious
to you than even the world itself.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:35.710
Kaede!

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.420
Congratulations.

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:46.880
Now you can finally have your
precious Kaede all to yourself.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.670
Let's feast on her together, shall we?

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:50.830
No!

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.920
You want to become a girl just like Kaede, don't you?

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.380
That's your deepest desire.

00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:58.830
You're wrong...

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.630
That's not... it's not what I want!

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:03.830
You're lying.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:08.630
You people with wishes that
can't be granted have it rough, huh?

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:10.580
I guess that's just how it goes.

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:13.250
Well then, we'll feast upon her by ourselves.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:14.500
Please don't!

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:15.920
Stop!

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:17.960
Wake up, Kaede!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.380
Stay away!

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:24.080
Kaede!

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.920
Sorry, I passed out for a sec.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:31.290
If you think things will just go back to normal,
then you're sorely mistaken.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:35.290
Because I'm going to keep living inside of you.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.080
The day will come when your desire...
will utterly destroy Kaede.

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:42.380
Are you okay, Haruko?!

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:44.580
Listen, Kaede...

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.630
I want to fight against the Oni alongside of you.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.170
But that's dangerous!

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.790
You risked your life to protect me and everyone else!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.750
I want to return the favor and
fight to keep you safe, Kaede!

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:58.960
I'll risk my life... to save hers...

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:04.290
There's only one person I want to save.
And I only fight for her sake.

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:07.040
I don't understand. What's so wrong about that?

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.420
It's not a question of right or wrong.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:13.500
My experience in life leads me
to trust egoists over philanthropists.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.670
I want you on my side.

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.210
Please join me.

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.790
Come on... all I'm asking for is your help.

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.460
Are you fostering an Oni inside of you, too?

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.790
Listen! I'm not interested in joining forces with the Oni!

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:41.210
Don't be foolish, little kitten.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.210
You have to aim to kill if you're going to fight me.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:50.130
Since you don't want to help me,
then I guess I'll just have to ask Kaede instead.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.790
Mou dou demo ii ya tte

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.580
Nagedashita kotae

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:26.380
Hakanaku saki hakanaku chiru kurikaeshi

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:29.920
Monotarinai mama de

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:32.830
Sou day by day ayunda

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:35.130
Cry mirai kurai

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:39.130
Mada tsukamenai twilight

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:41.500
Don't lose your way

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.670
Yume no himo musunde

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.080
Take me so high

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.960
Hashiri dasu brand new life

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:52.460
Everything I have in my hand

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.130
Nanatsu no iro daite

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.000
Go ahead, make my day

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.380
Kono te de aragae motto!

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.830
Everything I have in my hand

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:07.580
Risou kibou kaite

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.170
I won't let you down

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:12.460
Kono hana sakasete zutto!

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:16.130
Believe myself

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:28.000
<b>Determination</b>

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.040
I have been prepared to face my death...

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.710
for many ages now.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.460
Cease at once! This ritual must go no further!

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:43.630
Who dares?!

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.960
You know very well who I am.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:49.540
Do not interfere!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:53.500
The Myojin Shrine Maiden has willingly
offered her life to complete this ritual!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.630
This is a crucial moment that decides
the fate of our entire world!

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:59.790
That is why I have demanded you put an end to it!

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.380
Stay away from the maiden!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.420
Oni!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:17.080
We cannot claim victory without the power of the Oni.
Losing in war means our country shall perish!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.880
It matters not! We must never surrender our humanity!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.580
Shrine Maiden!

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:24.040
Think carefully.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:28.670
Your young life is not worth casting aside for the sake
of strangers with whom you have no connection.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:31.460
Come with me and I shall save you!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.880
So that is your answer.

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.040
Go and capture the maiden!

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:54.210
Consider yourself lucky, Enju.
Now Chisato doesn't have to die.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:55.880
We can't stop!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.380
There is no parent who would wish their own child dead!

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.420
But we have no other choice!

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.330
This is the only way!

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.500
No, Father!

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.920
Seize the maiden now!

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.330
Ibara.

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:31.670
Protect my daughter.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:33.710
Please.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:44.080
Enju... you were one selfish bastard.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.330
Ibara...

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:55.830
No other choice, huh?

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.290
Don't worry! There'll be another chance for the ritual!

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:02.580
Yes, you're right...

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:06.460
Oh, man. I should've kept my mouth shut.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:09.460
She's here.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.960
You wasted a lot of my time, brat.

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.380
I'm not letting you take Oka!

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:27.920
What?

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.790
I refuse... to let Oka die!

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:33.290
So you know what happens.

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:35.170
How can you be okay with this?!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.830
Oka is going to be a sacrifice!

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.040
Unless the ritual is performed to sever the connection,

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.330
the nether realm will swallow our world
and cause countless deaths.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:44.830
So what?!

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.630
The only one who can prevent
that from happening is Oka.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:50.420
It's what Oka has lived her whole life for.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.210
There's nothing we can do anymore.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:57.460
I don't see any point in saving a world
that's built upon human sacrifices!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.250
That's why, I'm going to protect Oka!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.330
Easy for you to say.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.500
Go ahead and interrupt the ritual.
It'll prove that you're a threat to humanity...

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.290
An Oni!

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:14.540
Oni?

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:16.540
Oni must be slayed!

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:21.130
Bring it!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:28.250
Call me an Oni! I don't care!

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:31.040
I'll protect Oka! No matter what!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.210
Ibara?

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:40.580
That's not Ibara.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.460
That Yoroi is a reflection of yourself.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:44.960
Of me?

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:47.170
All Yoroi respond to human will.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:51.290
And people who have overcome adversity
can draw strength from their will power.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.580
All right, Kakeru Miwa!

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.580
Show me how tough your will is!

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.130
Get serious already!

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:09.710
Eight years ago...

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:14.040
Whatever happened that day, the ritual was never
completed despite my mother sacrificing her life.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:19.170
If the ritual had just been successful back then,
then Oka wouldn't have to do it now!

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:23.040
But somehow you ended up the only survivor!
Everyone else there died!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.580
Aren't you the one who caused it?!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.130
It doesn't matter either way!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.830
Because I'm the one here now!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.500
And after I met Oka, I finally understood why I survived!

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:37.000
The reason that I'm standing here
right now is to save everyone!

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:40.420
"To save everyone"? You're full of shit!

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:42.380
I'm not letting anyone die!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:46.380
Just watch me! That's what I'm determined to do!

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:51.630
Kakeru Miwa!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.250
You're weak.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.250
Why the hell are you so weak?!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.330
Protect her like you said you would, dammit!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.080
I was ready to give up and let you do it.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.580
If you'd just beaten me and proved
you were strong enough to save her!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:16.210
Because... what I wanted deep down was....

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:19.080
for someone stronger than me
to defend Oka to the very end!

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.920
Then she'd live! She wouldn't have to sacrifice herself!

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:34.040
Lady Oka. I'm here to pick you up.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:39.790
Thank you.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.750
Enju Myojin...

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.080
Surrender the Shrine Maiden.

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:55.670
Not on your life.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:24.040
We're heading straight for the border between
the nether realm and our world in Obara.

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.210
That boy is finished.

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.540
I guess he couldn't pull off a miracle.

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:42.330
Is my father...?

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:44.790
He's dead.

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:49.580
But the good news is, you and I are both totally free now.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:53.380
Don't you feel great?
You don't have to be a sacrifice anymore.

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.250
I...

00:11:56.830 --> 00:12:00.460
I am going to try to complete
the Shikizakura ritual once again.

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:01.630
Huh?!

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:03.920
It's what I want to do.

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.710
I must sever the connection between
our world and the nether realm.

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:10.670
That's the only way to save the souls of those
who have succumbed to the Oni's power.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:12.750
What a load of crap.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.250
Shikizakura.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:23.330
Shikizakura.

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:31.710
All of those who were out of place have now
successfully been returned from whence they came.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:38.670
Hey Ibara. I have one last favor to ask of you...

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:42.460
Watch after that cherry blossom tree for me.

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:44.630
Screw that.

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:53.960
Ibara?!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:59.710
An Oni like me getting a free pass while a human
like you has to suffer... that seems backwards.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.710
Don't do it!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.080
Closing that gate is my duty!

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:07.710
Just listen.

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:10.500
I'm also granting Enju's dying wish.

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.000
My father's?

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:17.420
His only desire at the very end of it all...
it was to protect you.

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:19.880
Oh, Father...

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:21.880
Take my jewel.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:24.750
It's a good luck charm, so don't go loosing it.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:31.540
Ibara?!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.250
Catch ya later, Chisato.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.830
Let's watch those flowers bloom together... some day.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.380
Oka...

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:06.790
<b>Thank you for everything you did.</b>

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:06.790
<b>It's okay now. Please don't worry about me anymore.</b>

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:06.790
<b>From Oka</b>

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:10.210
G'morning, bucko!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:14.710
U-uh... good morning, sir.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:18.040
Weird stuff's going down in Nagoya right now.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.170
There has been widespread damage in every area.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:26.210
If you encounter any strange objects or people, do not
approach and stay as far away from them as possible.

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:27.630
Let me repeat that.

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.960
There has been widespread damage in every area.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:31.580
There's nothing funny about it, but I can't help but laugh.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:32.130
If you encounter any strange objects or people,

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.670
The world's going down the crapper.

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:34.960
do not approach and stay as far away from them as possible.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:36.960
<b>NO SERVICE</b>

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.040
The entire network is down, apparently.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.040
Let me repeat that.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.630
There has been widespread damage in every area.

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:42.080
No phone or internet. It's got everybody in a panic.

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:43.130
If you encounter any strange objects or people,

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.710
This is terrible...

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:44.580
do not approach and stay as far away fro-

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.960
<b>Technical Difficulties</b>

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.960
<b>Please Stand By</b>

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:46.790
I wonder if that girl is doing okay.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:52.130
I saw her leave during the night with someone
that I assume was her guardian or whatever.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.040
You think they'll be coming back soon?

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.040
She... won't be coming back.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.500
Huh?

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:06.380
Do you know... if she was able to see the ocean at all?

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.790
Dunno. It was pretty dark.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.750
<b>Thank you for everything you did.</b>

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.750
<b>It's okay now. Please don't worry about me anymore.</b>

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.750
<b>From Oka</b>

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:13.750
<b>P.S.</b>

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:13.750
<b>I saw a dream last night where you were all grown up.</b>

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.330
A dream?

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:18.250
That's not a replacement for the real thing!

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:21.500
So, that girl... she was ready to die, huh?

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:23.750
How did you...?

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:28.000
I've done this job for a long time now.
It's taught me how to read people, y'know?

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:31.790
Good job.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:33.540
You convinced her not to, right?

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.080
You've got it wrong.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.130
Huh?

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:41.330
I failed... I couldn't do a damn thing!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.210
Oh, really?

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:47.250
Wait, that's bad news! Was letting her go the right thing?

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.000
Absolutely not!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.540
But... I had no other choice.

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:55.460
Upsy-daisy.

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:57.920
You're way too young to sound so jaded!

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:00.460
C'mon! We can go after her in my car!

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.290
<b>BEER</b>

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.960
Sorry, kid! I'm too drunk to drive right now...

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:10.960
Thanks for everything.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:14.790
<b>Guesthouse</b>

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:14.790
<b>Matsuhikoso</b>

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:14.580
Good luck, kid! Bring that girl back with you sometime!

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.580
Don't you forget!

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.670
Kippei?! Why are you here?!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.420
Here's the thing, I actually have a super power.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:32.500
The power to know exactly when you're in big trouble!

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.540
Kippei!

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:42.080
I almost freaked out when I got
that call from the guesthouse.

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:47.250
But it turned out okay, since they thought
I was your dad or something. Talk about lucky!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:49.420
Hey, Kippei?

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:50.540
Huh?

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:54.540
Aren't you going to ask?
About what happened and why I'm here?

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:00.040
You're gonna tell me all about it
when it's okay to. Remember?

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:04.630
You're the best, Kippei. Thank you.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.040
<b>Prawn Cracker Village</b>

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:09.420
Oh my god, look.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.960
What is happening?

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.290
I'm scared.

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:18.040
<b>FULL</b>

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:18.040
<b>STEAM</b>

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:18.040
<b>AHEAD</b>

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:15.790
Get your hands off me!

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.420
There's something that I have to let the people know!

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:20.420
No way!

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:21.460
Is that Ryo?!

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:23.790
If you see this gemstone, stay away from it!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:26.130
They are traces of a connection to the nether realm!

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:29.290
Wherever these stones show up, Oni are sure to follow!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.040
Dammit! Please just hear me out! The Oni will-

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.040
That's all for now!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.330
Totally nuts.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:37.380
He may seem like he's crazy,
but Ryo is actually dead serious!

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:41.040
Uh... I know I may seem even crazier for saying that.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.960
I get it. The gemstones are dangerous, right?

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.290
Huh? Uh, yeah.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:52.710
If our boy Ryo is right about those stones being the result
of another world interfering with this one, then...

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.000
<b>Kippei's Top Secret Notebook #154</b>

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.000
<b>Strange Coincidence Between Eerie "Clouds"</b>

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.000
<b>In The Sky And Sudden Rainbow</b>

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.000
<b>Korankei</b>

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.000
<b>Gorge</b>

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.000
<b>Partially</b>

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:51.000
<b>Obstructed</b>

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.000
<b>Is This What Causes The High Temps In Tajimi City?!</b>

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.000
<b>The Megalith That Appeared</b>

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.000
<b>In Kasahara Town</b>

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.000
<b>Connection Between</b>

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.000
<b>Megalith's Orientation</b>

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:53.000
<b>And Toyota City's</b>

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:53.000
<b>Radioactive Clouds?</b>

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.290
You accepted that quick!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.710
I figured something like this would happen.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.040
Take a look, Kakeru.

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:01.500
<b>Toyota City</b>

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.380
What is this?

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:01.210
The locations of all those stones.

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:05.380
There's an obvious connection between where
the stones are and all the mysterious explosions!

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:07.920
And I think, the center of it all is...

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:10.540
Obara Village. Kamohara Shrine.

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.000
What?

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:14.330
The place where I was found alive.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:16.670
Kakeru?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:18.500
Don't worry, Kippei.

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.290
This is all going to end soon enough.

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:25.630
Because Oka is going to redo it today...
the ritual that failed 8 years ago.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:28.460
Oka is what? I don't understand.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:33.130
This has been going on ever since that day.
And now it will all end.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:37.250
But... it comes at a cost. Oka will disappear.

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.670
She's never coming back.

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:40.380
Huh?!

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:42.920
She has to be a sacrifice.

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:44.880
What?!

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:45.880
For real?!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:49.210
In the end, I wasn't able to do anything for her.

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:52.170
I couldn't save Oka... I'm a total failure!

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:56.710
They said this is the only way. Nothing can change that.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:18:59.880
I'm absolutely powerless now.

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:02.500
Kakeru...

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.710
Time for lunch!

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.960
I don't understand, but I get you.

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.540
It's like how I felt back then.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:14.670
Cool kids who want to hang at my house, gather up!

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:15.750
Me!

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.500
Okay, come over at 4!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:24.750
I felt so helpless. The world just
kept on turning like I didn't exist.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:26.790
But then...

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:28.040
Kippei!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.460
Let's have lunch together!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:32.170
Kippei!

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.330
What do you wanna play when we get home?

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:38.330
Kakeru showed up and pulled me out
of that funk that I was trapped in.

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:42.040
We gotta check this out!

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:48.040
You're a hero, Kakeru.

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:51.080
No, I'm not. I couldn't become one.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.330
You're a hero to me, dude.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:55.830
You saved me from a dark place.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:57.960
You've got that backwards...

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.880
I was able to change for the better thanks to you.

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.460
You have the power to do that for people.

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:08.920
Listen, man. You're way more amazing
than you give yourself credit for!

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:10.130
Be more confident!

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.960
But this is Oka's problem to deal with.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:15.630
There's just nothing that I can do.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.130
No. It's your problem, too!

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:20.330
Don't try and brush this off!

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:22.750
I...

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.380
Ask your heart! What is it telling you?

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.290
My heart...?

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.330
It's saying...

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.710
That I want to go and see Oka one more time!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.130
All right!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.460
I don't know what I'll do after that.

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:42.170
But... I have to go see her!

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:43.710
Hell yeah!

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:48.130
Obara Village! Here we come!

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:49.080
Hang on, Oka!

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:57.630
Ima kono shunkan ga owaranai you ni

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:01.630
Nan juu nen saki made tsuzukimasu you ni

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:08.040
Kirei na fuku datte kirenaku natte

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:12.460
Watashi dake ga inakunatta sekai de

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.630
Ano hi nigate datta cider

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.830
Kieta semi no koe

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.170
Unmei ni shizundeku

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:24.210
Mogaki kata mo wakarazu ni

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:29.040
Watashi no koto nante mietenai mitai de

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:32.920
Sakarau ki mo okinainda yo

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:38.580
Anata ga te o hiite kureta toki

00:21:39.210 --> 00:21:42.460
Mieta kirei na sekai no iro

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:45.080
Sakura no saku kisetsu ni

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:49.250
Mujaki ni warau sore ni tsurarete

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:53.330
Kawaranai koto nante nai

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:57.290
Kanashii mirai datte kitto sou desho

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:38.830
Say Haruko, where are you from again?

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:39.750
South America.

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:40.880
Oh, so am I!

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:42.290
And what's your favorite food?

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:43.130
Red shiso rice.

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:43.920
Same here!

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:44.670
And how old are you?

00:22:44.670 --> 00:22:45.880
758 years old.

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:46.790
Me too!

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Pulse</b>

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:47.630
Next time:

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:48.460
Pulse.

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:49.710
Is this fate or what?

00:22:49.710 --> 00:22:50.670
Go die in a fire.
